/**
 * @defgroup api API Documentation
 * @{
 * @brief API documentation for the ArgusAI system
 *
 * The ArgusAI system provides a RESTful API for interacting with the object detection
 * and segmentation capabilities. This documentation details all available endpoints,
 * request/response formats, and usage examples.
 *
 * @section api_base Base URL
 * All API endpoints are relative to the base URL:
 * ```
 * http://localhost:8000
 * ```
 *
 * @section api_endpoints Endpoints
 *
 * @subsection detection_endpoint Object Detection
 * @code
 * POST /detect
 * Content-Type: multipart/form-data
 * @endcode
 *
 * Request parameters:
 * - image: Image file (required)
 * - model: Model name (optional, default: "yolov8n")
 * - confidence: Detection confidence threshold (optional, default: 0.25)
 *
 * Response format:
 * @code{.json}
 * {
 *   "success": true,
 *   "detections": [
 *     {
 *       "class": "person",
 *       "confidence": 0.95,
 *       "bbox": [x1, y1, x2, y2]
 *     }
 *   ]
 * }
 * @endcode
 *
 * @subsection segmentation_endpoint Instance Segmentation
 * @code
 * POST /segment
 * Content-Type: multipart/form-data
 * @endcode
 *
 * Request parameters:
 * - image: Image file (required)
 * - model: Model name (optional, default: "yolov8n-seg")
 * - confidence: Detection confidence threshold (optional, default: 0.25)
 *
 * Response format:
 * @code{.json}
 * {
 *   "success": true,
 *   "segments": [
 *     {
 *       "class": "person",
 *       "confidence": 0.95,
 *       "mask": [[x1, y1], [x2, y2], ...]
 *     }
 *   ]
 * }
 * @endcode
 *
 * @subsection models_endpoint Available Models
 * @code
 * GET /models
 * @endcode
 *
 * Response format:
 * @code{.json}
 * {
 *   "models": [
 *     {
 *       "name": "yolov8n",
 *       "type": "detection",
 *       "size": "small"
 *     },
 *     {
 *       "name": "yolov8n-seg",
 *       "type": "segmentation",
 *       "size": "small"
 *     },
 *     {
 *       "name": "yolov8l",
 *       "type": "detection",
 *       "size": "large"
 *     }
 *   ]
 * }
 * @endcode
 *
 * @subsection status_endpoint System Status
 * @code
 * GET /status
 * @endcode
 *
 * Response format:
 * @code{.json}
 * {
 *   "status": "running",
 *   "version": "2.0",
 *   "models_loaded": ["yolov8n", "yolov8n-seg"],
 *   "gpu_available": true
 * }
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section api_errors Error Handling
 * All endpoints return appropriate HTTP status codes and error messages:
 * - 200: Success
 * - 400: Bad Request
 * - 404: Not Found
 * - 500: Internal Server Error
 *
 * Error response format:
 * @code{.json}
 * {
 *   "error": "Error message",
 *   "code": "ERROR_CODE"
 * }
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section api_authentication Authentication
 * Currently, the API does not require authentication. Future versions may implement
 * API key or token-based authentication.
 *
 * @section api_rate_limiting Rate Limiting
 * The API implements rate limiting to prevent abuse:
 * - 100 requests per minute per IP address
 * - Rate limit headers are included in responses
 *
 * @see backend
 * @}
 */ 